WEBVTT

01:38.110 --> 01:43.060
[Shadow Punisher]

01:43.130 --> 01:43.710
[Divine Constable Tally]

01:43.710 --> 01:45.940
[Episode 19]

01:46.640 --> 01:47.560
Qin Dayuan,

01:49.560 --> 01:51.479
I know you can hear me.

01:53.070 --> 01:55.000
Didn't you set up these 7 fish tanks

01:55.229 --> 01:56.039
just to let me

01:56.039 --> 01:57.430
see through the mechanism

01:57.430 --> 01:58.870
and lure me to this place?

02:00.040 --> 02:01.070
If so,

02:01.480 --> 02:03.510
why are you hiding now?

02:15.560 --> 02:16.280
If I recall correctly,

02:16.280 --> 02:17.590
Tang Wei was unmarried, right?

02:17.590 --> 02:18.310
Yes.

02:18.560 --> 02:20.430
Tang Yiming died 10 years ago.

02:20.590 --> 02:22.280
Tang Wei attained an epiphany
and devoted himself to Taoism,

02:22.280 --> 02:23.540
vowing never to marry.

02:23.680 --> 02:24.710
If so,

02:25.000 --> 02:25.860
check that out.

02:27.870 --> 02:28.630
Why is there

02:28.630 --> 02:29.960
a baby's pillow?

02:30.150 --> 02:31.360
And why is this baby's pillow

02:31.360 --> 02:32.800
made of stone?

02:48.590 --> 02:50.650
The fish tanks are all in the same spot

02:51.030 --> 02:52.190
in each room from the 1st floor

02:52.190 --> 02:53.430
to the 7th.

02:55.630 --> 02:58.690
The spots where the moonlight
reflects on the ceilings

02:59.210 --> 03:01.240
through the fish tanks,

03:01.430 --> 03:03.030
from the 1st to the 7th floors,

03:03.030 --> 03:04.590
are also almost the same.

03:11.470 --> 03:13.200
Except for this huge deviation

03:14.190 --> 03:15.840
on the 7th floor.

03:16.870 --> 03:18.120
This is due to

03:20.190 --> 03:22.190
the different height of this floor.

03:22.240 --> 03:22.960
Each floor

03:22.960 --> 03:25.000
of Lanyue Pavilion from the 1st to the 6th

03:25.000 --> 03:26.680
is about 5 meters high.

03:27.000 --> 03:28.310
But this 7th floor

03:28.750 --> 03:30.520
is clearly much shorter.

03:30.840 --> 03:32.770
There's only one way to explain it—

03:32.960 --> 03:34.800
there is a hidden space

03:35.430 --> 03:37.280
above this 7th floor.

05:16.040 --> 05:17.070
Something's off.

05:17.630 --> 05:19.560
This mechanism is way too obvious.

05:19.750 --> 05:21.800
We just found out Tang Wei
committed suicide,

05:21.800 --> 05:22.540
and then you guys

05:22.540 --> 05:24.430
found his suicide note so quickly?

05:24.430 --> 05:26.030
Tang Wei's parents are dead.

05:26.070 --> 05:27.530
He had no wife or children.

05:27.630 --> 05:29.040
Then who did he

05:29.480 --> 05:31.040
write this suicide note to?

05:31.430 --> 05:32.690
And who does this word,

05:33.040 --> 05:34.510
"you," refer to?

05:34.800 --> 05:36.730
Seems like Tang Wei's suicide note

05:37.480 --> 05:38.870
was also meant for us.

06:30.560 --> 06:31.480
Qin Dayuan,

06:32.270 --> 06:34.040
if you still don't show yourself,

06:34.040 --> 06:35.870
don't blame me for being rude.

07:16.160 --> 07:16.950
Huang Gang.

07:24.630 --> 07:25.600
Jiang Zeshui.

07:25.830 --> 07:27.510
Ascend to Heaven.

07:33.680 --> 07:35.220
Is this

07:35.560 --> 07:38.820
General Hu Hai who jumped
into the furnace for liberation?

08:00.190 --> 08:02.270
I once read the records
in Tianshu Pavilion.

08:02.270 --> 08:04.560
"Liluo has pearls, often seen in darkness;

08:04.560 --> 08:07.190
they don't gleam like the moon,
but blaze like the sun."

08:07.190 --> 08:08.630
So it's a luminous pearl.

08:08.800 --> 08:10.630
Throughout the records
of hundreds of years,

08:10.630 --> 08:12.070
there is only one luminous pearl

08:12.070 --> 08:13.200
as large as this one.

08:13.240 --> 08:15.120
It is Liluo's national treasure,

08:15.270 --> 08:16.200
the Mirror Moon.

08:16.430 --> 08:18.040
After Liluo fell, they searched

08:18.040 --> 08:19.020
the entire national treasury

08:19.020 --> 08:20.360
but failed to find this Mirror Moon.

08:20.360 --> 08:21.830
Never thought it would be here.

08:21.830 --> 08:22.950
Tang Yiming was an official

08:22.950 --> 08:25.040
credited with conquering Liluo back then.

08:25.040 --> 08:26.160
He must have

08:26.480 --> 08:27.530
looted plenty of treasures

08:27.530 --> 08:29.330
from the Liluo Imperial Palace.

08:30.750 --> 08:33.150
Who exactly is this corpse?

08:38.630 --> 08:39.549
Qin Dayuan?

08:40.240 --> 08:42.080
Then who is

08:42.360 --> 08:43.690
inside this 4th statue?

08:44.080 --> 08:44.910
The corpse

08:44.910 --> 08:46.550
inside this 4th statue

08:47.150 --> 08:49.080
is the former Minister of Works.

08:52.510 --> 08:53.910
He was also my master,

08:55.120 --> 08:56.080
Tang Yiming.

08:57.910 --> 08:59.440
Why is he here?

08:59.910 --> 09:01.370
He went missing 3 days ago.

09:01.510 --> 09:02.840
Why did he die here?

09:11.870 --> 09:12.960
Butler Qin.

09:17.510 --> 09:18.960
It must've been rough,

09:19.840 --> 09:21.840
lurking in the darkness

09:21.910 --> 09:23.910
on the 8th floor of Lanyue Pavilion.

09:23.960 --> 09:25.160
But it's reasonable.

09:25.910 --> 09:28.360
The Divine Constable Bureau
is searching everywhere.

09:28.360 --> 09:30.020
There's no way you can escape.

09:30.080 --> 09:30.910
Well?

09:32.270 --> 09:33.270
At this point,

09:34.440 --> 09:36.500
are you still not going to come clean?

09:41.320 --> 09:42.650
How should I come clean?

09:43.670 --> 09:44.650
Why don't we

09:45.510 --> 09:47.360
start with Kongyuzi?

09:51.080 --> 09:53.080
Since you mentioned this name,

09:53.960 --> 09:55.910
you must know she was my wife.

09:56.150 --> 09:58.150
You were husband and wife after all.

09:59.080 --> 10:01.270
Why did you have to kill her?

10:04.720 --> 10:05.510
Because

10:06.670 --> 10:07.910
there was one thing

10:08.510 --> 10:09.910
you couldn't accomplish

10:10.440 --> 10:12.510
without killing her.

10:14.870 --> 10:16.470
Divine Constable Qingyang.

10:18.960 --> 10:20.440
Do you want to guess...

10:23.080 --> 10:24.360
what I

10:25.240 --> 10:26.100
accomplished?

10:30.960 --> 10:31.790
Huang Gang,

10:32.960 --> 10:34.080
Jiang Zeshui,

10:34.320 --> 10:35.840
Hu Hai, Tang Yiming—

10:36.080 --> 10:37.150
the four of them

10:37.360 --> 10:39.420
once joined forces to destroy Liluo.

10:40.080 --> 10:41.200
Their deaths

10:42.080 --> 10:43.790
are Liluo's revenge.

10:44.120 --> 10:45.630
You got it half right.

10:46.240 --> 10:47.640
Huang Gang and the others

10:48.550 --> 10:50.240
caused too much bloodshed

10:50.720 --> 10:52.250
when they destroyed Liluo,

10:52.670 --> 10:54.020
so it was only natural

10:54.080 --> 10:55.340
for them to feel uneasy

10:56.080 --> 10:57.550
when they got old.

11:00.720 --> 11:02.480
Hu Hai and the other two
were long in the tooth.

11:02.480 --> 11:03.200
Because they had

11:03.200 --> 11:05.260
their hands coated in too much blood,

11:05.270 --> 11:06.670
they were scared of death

11:06.960 --> 11:08.720
and sought medical help everywhere,

11:08.720 --> 11:11.030
but to little avail.

11:13.440 --> 11:14.240
Therefore,

11:14.870 --> 11:16.480
Mr. Tang told them

11:16.840 --> 11:19.970
that he knew the way
to seek immortality and liberation.

11:20.390 --> 11:21.200
Hu Hai

11:22.630 --> 11:24.060
was the first one.

11:24.480 --> 11:25.480
The Young Master built

11:25.480 --> 11:27.240
a secret passage
in the sword-forging furnace.

11:27.240 --> 11:29.910
When Hu Hai fell
into the furnace for liberation,

11:29.910 --> 11:32.200
he took Hu Hai away, killed him,

11:32.360 --> 11:33.550
and sealed him here.

11:33.870 --> 11:35.870
Mr. Tang couldn't use martial arts.

11:36.440 --> 11:37.270
So of course,

11:37.510 --> 11:39.240
the Liluo demon-men helped him

11:39.320 --> 11:40.980
do everything you mentioned.

11:41.870 --> 11:44.390
But Huang Gang and Jiang Zeshui

11:44.670 --> 11:46.870
were no easy marks like Hu Hai.

11:47.510 --> 11:48.320
So,

11:49.360 --> 11:51.840
you renovated the Jiang Mansion
and Huang Mansion,

11:51.840 --> 11:53.080
using Lanweichun

11:53.550 --> 11:55.270
to hide the image of Haiqu,

11:55.270 --> 11:56.600
Liluo's God of Revenge,

11:56.670 --> 11:58.550
in the mural.

11:58.870 --> 12:00.480
This caused Haiqu's figure

12:00.550 --> 12:02.080
to flicker in and out of view,

12:02.080 --> 12:03.240
forcing the two veterans

12:03.240 --> 12:05.200
to believe in

12:05.480 --> 12:07.810
Tang Wei's theory of mystic cultivation.

12:13.030 --> 12:13.870
That day,

12:14.720 --> 12:16.270
Mr. Tang accurately foretold

12:16.270 --> 12:17.600
the date of his own death

12:17.840 --> 12:20.080
and jumped from this Lanyue Pavilion,

12:20.550 --> 12:23.080
convincing Huang Gang and the others

12:23.080 --> 12:24.270
completely.

12:24.870 --> 12:25.720
And then,

12:26.320 --> 12:28.120
he entrusted everything to you,

12:28.630 --> 12:30.320
leaving you to carry out

12:30.320 --> 12:31.750
the rest of the plan.

12:36.080 --> 12:37.680
You guessed this part right.

12:40.360 --> 12:42.220
In order to achieve immortality,

12:42.840 --> 12:43.720
they all

12:44.080 --> 12:46.140
ended up believing Tang Wei's words.

12:47.240 --> 12:48.030
Hence,

12:48.320 --> 12:50.720
Huang Gang climbed up
the "heaven ladder,"

12:51.120 --> 12:52.850
Jiang Zeshui crossed the lake,

12:53.440 --> 12:55.270
and Hu Hai jumped
into the sword-forging furnace.

12:55.270 --> 12:56.360
But in the end,

12:57.270 --> 12:59.080
they were all captured
by the Liluo demon-men

12:59.080 --> 13:00.440
and brought here.

13:02.510 --> 13:04.440
With the Liluo people on my side,

13:04.440 --> 13:05.440
why would I go

13:05.440 --> 13:07.080
to so much trouble

13:07.320 --> 13:10.050
instead of asking them
to kill the guys directly?

13:11.720 --> 13:13.580
You made Lord Huang and the others

13:13.840 --> 13:15.790
believe that ascension was real,

13:16.360 --> 13:18.120
only to reveal everything

13:18.120 --> 13:19.910
at the very last moment when they were

13:19.910 --> 13:21.440
so close to fulfilling their wishes,

13:21.440 --> 13:22.510
and tell them

13:22.720 --> 13:25.480
that ascension was actually a lie,

13:26.080 --> 13:28.080
letting them die in fear.

13:29.120 --> 13:30.000
Only in this way

13:30.630 --> 13:33.790
could the revenge be satisfying.

13:34.320 --> 13:35.750
The Master reached the immortal land.

13:35.750 --> 13:38.080
The whole Huang family fell off the cliff.

13:38.360 --> 13:39.870
Hu Hai's beloved little granddaughter

13:39.870 --> 13:40.870
took poison.

13:41.750 --> 13:43.810
If we hadn't arrived in time that day,

13:44.080 --> 13:47.340
the whole Jiang family would have
drowned in the lake, too.

13:51.320 --> 13:53.180
What a cruel and ruthless scheme.

13:54.080 --> 13:55.150
To seek revenge,

13:56.080 --> 13:58.140
you wiped out their entire families.

13:58.440 --> 14:01.670
Huang Gang, Jiang Zeshui, and Hu Hai.

14:02.320 --> 14:04.380
I brought the three of them over here.

14:04.510 --> 14:06.550
I told them ascension was a lie,

14:07.080 --> 14:08.600
and it was their greed

14:09.720 --> 14:11.520
that got their families killed,

14:11.840 --> 14:13.480
leaving them crying out

14:13.720 --> 14:15.240
in remorse

14:15.320 --> 14:17.270
with no response.

14:18.080 --> 14:19.010
My Lord, My Lady!

14:19.270 --> 14:20.270
My Lord, My Lady,

14:20.270 --> 14:21.120
Lord Yan reported that

14:21.120 --> 14:21.870
Divine Constable Qingyang

14:21.870 --> 14:23.600
went up Lanyue Pavilion alone!

14:23.720 --> 14:25.240
He went to Lanyue Pavilion alone.

14:25.240 --> 14:26.100
Could it be that

14:26.630 --> 14:27.960
he found out something?

14:29.120 --> 14:31.050
There is one thing that puzzles me.

14:31.630 --> 14:33.160
Tang Wei is one of the Tangs.

14:34.030 --> 14:36.030
Why would he take revenge for Liluo?

14:39.720 --> 14:41.920
Master Tang had a large and rich family,

14:42.150 --> 14:44.240
yet Tang Wei was his only child.

14:45.360 --> 14:46.080
Could it be...

14:46.080 --> 14:51.390
Because Tang Yiming was impotent.

14:52.150 --> 14:54.240
Tang Wei was not Tang Yiming's child?

14:55.320 --> 14:56.550
He was from Liluo?

15:01.080 --> 15:04.280
Divine Constable Qingyang,
you've finally got it right.

15:05.360 --> 15:07.030
How about I tell you

15:07.320 --> 15:08.360
a story?

15:12.550 --> 15:13.880
Forty-seven years ago,

15:14.910 --> 15:17.240
Great Shi attacked the capital of Liluo,

15:18.670 --> 15:22.080
while the Moon Queen of the Kingdom
of Liluo, Qiangong Linglong,

15:22.080 --> 15:23.600
was about to give birth.

15:25.860 --> 15:28.490
[Qiangong Linglong,
Regent Moon Queen of Liluo]

15:39.030 --> 15:40.360
Greetings, Moon Queen.

15:40.960 --> 15:43.290
Who is the father
of the child in your womb?

15:43.360 --> 15:45.090
Please forgive me, Moon Queen.

15:45.240 --> 15:46.630
The child is innocent.

15:47.150 --> 15:48.270
My child

15:48.630 --> 15:50.360
is also your child.

15:50.670 --> 15:52.120
He will surely dedicate everything

15:52.120 --> 15:54.630
to you, Holy Queen.

15:54.870 --> 15:56.420
Please don't kill him.

15:56.960 --> 15:59.690
Please allow him
to sacrifice himself for Liluo.

16:02.910 --> 16:05.110
You are very loyal to me, the Holy Queen.

16:05.630 --> 16:06.670
In this case,

16:07.670 --> 16:08.750
I hereby allow you

16:08.960 --> 16:11.150
to sacrifice your life for Liluo.

16:23.510 --> 16:24.750
I see.

16:26.320 --> 16:28.380
Thank you for your mercy, Moon Queen.

17:17.579 --> 17:18.450
[Huang Gang]

17:23.220 --> 17:24.990
[Jiang Zeshui]

17:39.730 --> 17:41.350
[Hu Hai]

17:52.780 --> 17:54.550
[Tang Yiming]

18:07.030 --> 18:08.480
She is in the Moon Robe.

18:08.650 --> 18:10.920
Holy Queen, Qiangong Linglong.

18:11.070 --> 18:12.600
We must eliminate the root!

18:13.200 --> 18:14.000
Hold on!

18:16.270 --> 18:19.010
The child is innocent.

18:20.640 --> 18:21.440
Tell me!

18:22.350 --> 18:23.760
Where is the treasure vault

18:23.760 --> 18:24.400
of Liluo?

18:24.830 --> 18:26.110
Tell us what you know,

18:26.110 --> 18:27.680
and we can spare your life.

18:27.840 --> 18:28.960
You are wrong.

18:29.880 --> 18:31.540
Liluo's sorcery is powerful.

18:31.640 --> 18:33.110
Only if we kill their leader

18:33.110 --> 18:34.720
can we shatter their morale

18:34.720 --> 18:36.450
and secure a complete victory.

18:36.510 --> 18:38.200
Let me be frank with you.

18:38.640 --> 18:40.300
We'll both take the treasures

18:40.350 --> 18:42.070
and your life.

18:42.510 --> 18:43.440
However,

18:43.640 --> 18:45.310
if you tell us,

18:45.880 --> 18:47.880
we can give you a quick death.

18:48.880 --> 18:50.140
Will you tell us or not?

18:50.640 --> 18:52.040
Guys, guys, listen to me.

18:52.310 --> 18:53.270
Having the Moon Queen of Liluo

18:53.270 --> 18:54.720
and the little prince as hostages,

18:54.720 --> 18:55.960
we can make the remnants of Liluo

18:55.960 --> 18:56.960
hesitate to attack

18:56.960 --> 18:58.110
and yield to us.

18:58.750 --> 18:59.720
Tang,

19:00.030 --> 19:01.550
do not be excessively soft-hearted.

19:01.550 --> 19:02.880
She is at death's door

19:02.880 --> 19:04.070
and still refuses to say anything.

19:04.070 --> 19:05.480
The so-called Liluo treasures

19:05.480 --> 19:07.200
are probably just a rumor.

19:07.310 --> 19:08.110
That's right.

19:08.480 --> 19:10.480
We can kill this woman first

19:10.510 --> 19:12.440
and then go look for the treasures.

19:13.960 --> 19:15.640
Let's go find the treasures.

19:15.640 --> 19:16.310
Understood!

19:16.310 --> 19:17.110
Let's go.

19:26.110 --> 19:26.920
Guys,

19:26.920 --> 19:28.310
we've killed the enemy leader.

19:28.310 --> 19:29.750
We won.

19:29.880 --> 19:32.350
Long live His Majesty! All hail Great Shi!

19:32.350 --> 19:35.160
-Long live His Majesty! All hail Great Shi!
-Long live His Majesty! All hail Great Shi!

19:35.160 --> 19:36.960
Tang, what are you waiting for?

19:37.310 --> 19:38.480
His Majesty has decreed

19:38.480 --> 19:39.720
to arrange a 3-day celebration

19:39.720 --> 19:41.190
for us outside the city.

19:43.770 --> 19:47.840
Save my child...

19:52.270 --> 19:53.830
They didn't know that

19:53.980 --> 19:55.100
after they left,

19:55.590 --> 19:58.020
my master granted that woman's request

19:58.050 --> 20:00.550
and saved her child before she died.

20:18.640 --> 20:20.370
Master Tang felt sorry for them

20:20.650 --> 20:22.210
and took the child in.

20:23.080 --> 20:25.910
That child was Tang Wei.

20:26.510 --> 20:27.310
Exactly.

20:30.790 --> 20:31.590
Later,

20:32.350 --> 20:35.200
the Liluo demon-men told Tang Wei
what happened

20:35.350 --> 20:36.550
back then.

20:38.110 --> 20:39.920
The Young Master had long wanted revenge,

20:39.920 --> 20:41.920
but Huang, Jiang, and the others held

20:41.920 --> 20:43.310
high positions and great power back then.

20:43.310 --> 20:44.590
Moreover, my master

20:44.960 --> 20:46.550
saved the Young Master's life

20:46.550 --> 20:47.880
and raised him,

20:48.160 --> 20:48.960
so

20:49.110 --> 20:52.310
the Young Master couldn't bring himself
to hurt the Master.

20:52.310 --> 20:53.840
Therefore, he kept waiting

20:54.030 --> 20:55.160
and enduring it all

20:56.310 --> 20:57.590
until 10 years ago.

20:59.880 --> 21:01.220
Until 10 years ago,

21:01.720 --> 21:03.550
he finally made a move
against Master Tang?

21:03.550 --> 21:04.160
Nope,

21:04.160 --> 21:05.760
Master Tang died of illness.

21:06.480 --> 21:07.550
Over the decades,

21:07.960 --> 21:08.920
the Young Master inherited

21:08.920 --> 21:11.850
all my master's techniques
in crafting and carving.

21:11.880 --> 21:12.680
So he faked

21:12.700 --> 21:16.050
master's ascension to Heaven
on a wooden bird

21:16.720 --> 21:18.450
and took over Lanyue Pavilion.

21:19.240 --> 21:20.030
Therefore,

21:20.920 --> 21:22.070
Huang Gang and the others

21:22.070 --> 21:23.480
firmly believed in the cultivation

21:23.480 --> 21:24.880
to immortality Tang Wei said

21:24.880 --> 21:25.880
only because

21:26.960 --> 21:28.550
they witnessed Tang Yiming's ascension

21:28.550 --> 21:31.410
to the immortal realm
with their own eyes back then?

21:33.880 --> 21:35.920
Back then, in the secret chamber
of the Imperial Palace,

21:35.920 --> 21:36.880
the Young Master's mother

21:36.880 --> 21:39.070
died in fear.

21:40.480 --> 21:41.640
So the Young Master

21:42.240 --> 21:43.510
wanted them to taste

21:43.510 --> 21:44.640
that feeling, too.

21:51.640 --> 21:52.440
I think

21:53.790 --> 21:54.720
Tang Wei must've

21:55.720 --> 21:57.550
lived in agony all these years.

21:58.110 --> 21:58.960
His death

21:59.790 --> 22:00.920
somehow delivered him

22:00.920 --> 22:02.270
from torment.

22:02.310 --> 22:03.160
Nonsense.

22:03.400 --> 22:04.550
The Young Master got his revenge

22:04.550 --> 22:05.960
and died with a smile,

22:06.510 --> 22:07.720
not in agony.

22:09.350 --> 22:12.270
Divine Constable Qingyang,
your life's been smooth sailing.

22:12.270 --> 22:14.130
You could never understand this.

22:18.160 --> 22:19.640
I understand, of course.

22:20.750 --> 22:22.080
I just don't understand

22:22.270 --> 22:24.160
why you only remember

22:24.350 --> 22:25.750
Young Master Tang's feud

22:26.350 --> 22:28.480
but ignore Master Tang's grace.

22:31.310 --> 22:33.110
My family's land deed was seized

22:33.400 --> 22:35.240
by Master Tang back then,

22:35.550 --> 22:38.380
so I was forced
to be sold to the Tang family

22:38.510 --> 22:39.910
and bullied by everyone.

22:40.350 --> 22:41.880
At that time, everyone in the Tang Mansion

22:41.880 --> 22:43.240
looked down on me,

22:43.920 --> 22:47.120
except for the Young Master,
who treated me with respect.

22:47.270 --> 22:48.830
So the Young Master's wish

22:49.590 --> 22:51.110
is my wish.

22:52.350 --> 22:53.510
I see.

22:54.160 --> 22:55.360
I've had his revenge.

22:56.750 --> 22:57.880
Divine Constable Qingyang,

22:57.880 --> 22:58.680
come on!

23:00.510 --> 23:02.370
Arrest me and bring me to justice.

23:11.350 --> 23:12.270
Butler Qin,

23:12.510 --> 23:14.510
since you are okay with being arrested,

23:14.510 --> 23:16.510
why have you been hiding here?

23:19.720 --> 23:20.650
Because I wanted

23:20.790 --> 23:22.350
to lure
the Divine Constable Bureau's personnel

23:22.350 --> 23:24.340
to the 8th floor of Lanyue Pavilion

23:24.480 --> 23:25.550
and tell you

23:25.960 --> 23:27.310
what

23:27.350 --> 23:29.510
those four people have done.

23:29.960 --> 23:33.620
Only when the Divine Constables
reveal the truth to the public...

23:35.150 --> 23:36.680
can the Young Master and his mother

23:36.680 --> 23:37.830
rest

23:38.400 --> 23:39.830
in peace.

23:42.680 --> 23:44.280
So that's how it is.

23:44.350 --> 23:45.370
So,

23:46.000 --> 23:48.000
you were afraid we couldn't find you

23:48.270 --> 23:49.920
and even spread the news that

23:50.510 --> 23:53.000
Butler Qin came to Lanyue Pavilion

23:53.000 --> 23:55.200
to mourn for his young master 3 days ago.

23:57.070 --> 23:58.930
I've been waiting not only for you

23:59.310 --> 24:00.110
but also

24:02.720 --> 24:04.050
for the people of Liluo.

24:09.310 --> 24:10.110
Zhenzhu!

24:10.110 --> 24:10.880
Yan,

24:11.070 --> 24:11.920
at the Tang Mansion,

24:11.920 --> 24:13.630
we found Qin Dayuan's body

24:13.920 --> 24:15.750
as well as the Liluo treasures.

24:16.030 --> 24:16.920
What?

24:17.110 --> 24:18.910
It even involved the treasures?

24:22.550 --> 24:25.750
If Dark Night comes to search this place,

24:26.240 --> 24:27.030
then

24:27.310 --> 24:29.680
the Divine Constable Bureau
can easily catch them like rats in a trap

24:29.680 --> 24:32.030
and purge Dark Night in one fell swoop.

24:33.070 --> 24:34.090
However...

24:35.680 --> 24:37.550
Butler Qin, how did you know

24:37.960 --> 24:39.400
that once you disappeared,

24:39.400 --> 24:40.350
Dark Night

24:40.350 --> 24:42.550
would definitely come looking for you?

24:44.790 --> 24:46.250
What do you think, My Lord?

24:54.310 --> 24:57.680
For the Tang household to have the money
to build this Lanyue Pavilion,

24:57.680 --> 24:59.440
they must have made a killing.

25:01.750 --> 25:02.640
Could it be...

25:05.960 --> 25:07.160
The Liluo treasures?

25:26.510 --> 25:27.710
The Liluo treasures?

25:28.070 --> 25:29.750
There really are the Liluo treasures!

25:29.750 --> 25:31.400
My master secretly brought back
the treasures

25:31.400 --> 25:32.400
of the Kingdom of Liluo

25:32.400 --> 25:34.750
and hid them in the secret chamber
of the Tang Mansion.

25:34.750 --> 25:35.750
The people of Dark Night

25:35.750 --> 25:37.310
are desperate to get the treasures

25:37.310 --> 25:39.400
to bankroll the overthrow of Great Shi.

25:39.400 --> 25:40.550
But they have no clue about

25:40.550 --> 25:42.480
the whereabouts of the treasures.

25:43.480 --> 25:45.510
After Master Tang and Mr. Tang died,

25:45.960 --> 25:47.200
you're the only one who knows

25:47.200 --> 25:48.930
the location of the treasures.

25:49.110 --> 25:50.370
When you disappeared,

25:50.400 --> 25:51.750
the Liluo demon-men

25:51.750 --> 25:53.110
had to go find you.

25:53.750 --> 25:55.950
I had already arranged it before I came.

25:56.480 --> 25:59.480
The treasure is left
to the Divine Constable Bureau.

26:06.590 --> 26:07.400
Weird.

26:07.720 --> 26:09.680
It was just reasonable for Tang Wei

26:10.440 --> 26:11.880
to take revenge on Great Shi.

26:11.880 --> 26:12.680
But

26:13.480 --> 26:14.480
why would he want

26:14.480 --> 26:16.880
to eliminate the Liluo demon-men
who helped him

26:16.880 --> 26:18.270
take revenge as well?

26:19.070 --> 26:20.070
What do you think?

26:21.480 --> 26:23.070
Qingyang should still be up there.

26:23.070 --> 26:23.920
Calm down.

26:23.920 --> 26:25.510
Meng is on his way here with the body.

26:25.510 --> 26:26.830
How can I calm down?

26:27.750 --> 26:29.200
I'm almost worried sick!

26:41.880 --> 26:43.340
The Liluo imperial family

26:43.750 --> 26:46.590
used Tang Wei's mother as a scapegoat,

26:46.960 --> 26:48.920
so they could escape unscathed.

26:50.070 --> 26:50.880
Therefore,

26:52.110 --> 26:53.830
to Tang Wei and his mother,

26:54.480 --> 26:55.310
the Liluo imperial family

26:55.310 --> 26:57.110
were also their bitter enemies,

26:57.680 --> 26:59.680
just like Huang Gang and the others.

27:08.480 --> 27:09.640
Butler Qin,

27:10.880 --> 27:13.280
there is one more thing
I'd like to confirm.

27:13.510 --> 27:14.880
Who on earth

27:15.350 --> 27:16.480
is the former citizen of Liluo

27:16.480 --> 27:18.480
who had been in contact with Tang Wei

27:18.880 --> 27:20.240
over the past 3 decades?

27:28.310 --> 27:29.440
Let me think.

28:01.160 --> 28:02.000
Gunpowder?

28:03.460 --> 28:04.700
My wish is fulfilled.

28:05.310 --> 28:07.040
Once I activate the mechanism,

28:07.310 --> 28:09.910
the entire Lanyue Pavilion
will be blown away!

28:09.920 --> 28:11.240
Wouldn't it be a pity

28:11.480 --> 28:12.960
to destroy the Top 1 Pavilion

28:12.960 --> 28:14.240
just like this?

28:14.240 --> 28:15.000
Pity?

28:15.350 --> 28:16.230
Not at all.

28:17.510 --> 28:18.970
What a pity that the people

28:19.070 --> 28:20.400
of Liluo didn't come.

28:21.960 --> 28:22.750
Wait!

28:23.350 --> 28:24.830
You can kill me,

28:25.310 --> 28:26.400
but you cannot stop me

28:26.400 --> 28:27.880
from igniting the gunpowder.

28:27.880 --> 28:30.110
You've taken such great pains
for this all these years.

28:30.110 --> 28:31.830
I don't want you to end up

28:31.850 --> 28:33.710
dying without knowing the truth.

28:34.110 --> 28:35.880
You have waited for years.

28:35.880 --> 28:37.220
It doesn't hurt to wait

28:37.550 --> 28:38.510
just a bit longer, right?

28:38.510 --> 28:39.270
Li Si!

28:39.920 --> 28:41.320
There is gunpowder here!

28:41.830 --> 28:42.640
No!

28:43.110 --> 28:44.370
Don't come any closer!

28:45.320 --> 28:46.440
No one can stop me

28:46.440 --> 28:47.900
from reuniting with my young master.

28:47.900 --> 28:48.830
"Young master"?

28:48.980 --> 28:50.830
Is Tang Wei really your young master?

28:50.830 --> 28:51.950
Or rather,

28:52.240 --> 28:53.880
are you really Qin Dayuan?

28:54.070 --> 28:55.400
Are you out of your mind?

28:56.160 --> 28:57.640
He is my young master,

28:58.110 --> 29:00.200
the one I have followed all my life.

29:00.310 --> 29:01.310
In this case,

29:01.680 --> 29:02.880
see who this is.

29:03.310 --> 29:04.110
Bring it over.

29:15.680 --> 29:17.240
Yan, go find the Chief.

29:17.240 --> 29:17.920
Got it.

29:20.830 --> 29:21.640
What...

29:24.960 --> 29:26.110
What happened?

29:28.270 --> 29:29.480
What's this all about?

29:29.480 --> 29:30.400
Sir,

29:31.310 --> 29:33.910
Kongyuzi,
whom you killed with your own hands,

29:33.920 --> 29:36.050
was not your wife, actually.

29:36.200 --> 29:36.880
You...

29:37.990 --> 29:39.520
What are you talking about?

29:53.920 --> 29:55.720
The moon's reflection
turns into the flower in the mirror,

29:55.720 --> 29:57.440
replacing old forms with new faces.

29:57.440 --> 29:58.750
As one of the Five Wonders of Liluo,

29:58.750 --> 30:00.880
the Illusion of Mirrors and Water
is indeed

30:00.880 --> 30:03.680
an unparalleled disguise technique
in the world.

30:04.240 --> 30:05.030
Zhenzhu,

30:05.880 --> 30:07.280
check the back of his head

30:07.510 --> 30:09.570
and see if there's anything unusual.

30:37.350 --> 30:39.610
He is really not Qin Dayuan, as expected.

30:41.640 --> 30:42.880
I am Qin Dayuan.

30:42.880 --> 30:44.440
I-I am Qin Dayuan.

30:45.110 --> 30:46.680
The Illusion of Mirrors and Water

30:46.680 --> 30:47.680
can completely alter

30:47.680 --> 30:49.550
a person's skin, flesh,

30:49.550 --> 30:50.780
and even bones,

30:50.880 --> 30:51.640
making the one truly

30:51.640 --> 30:53.170
become a different person.

30:53.680 --> 30:54.830
Since it is sorcery,

30:54.880 --> 30:56.400
how could it be used in Tianhuang City

30:56.400 --> 30:58.260
under the Absolute Prohibition?

31:00.070 --> 31:02.270
This is just
a martial arts mental technique,

31:02.270 --> 31:03.400
not sorcery.

31:04.270 --> 31:05.510
The Illusion of Mirrors and Water

31:05.510 --> 31:07.310
can not only change his appearance

31:07.310 --> 31:09.580
but also his figure and voice?

31:09.750 --> 31:12.010
What... What did I originally look like?

31:12.110 --> 31:13.030
I want to see.

31:20.240 --> 31:21.310
See for yourself.

31:30.640 --> 31:32.270
Who is he? Who?

31:33.070 --> 31:33.880
You still

31:33.880 --> 31:35.480
haven't recalled anything?

31:36.680 --> 31:39.680
You are the former Minister of Works,

31:40.100 --> 31:41.970
the world's greatest craftsman,

31:42.270 --> 31:45.000
Lord Tang Yiming.

31:46.510 --> 31:47.790
He is Tang Yiming?

31:48.110 --> 31:48.750
But...

31:48.750 --> 31:50.590
But Tang Yiming is already dead,

31:50.720 --> 31:51.510
right?

31:52.960 --> 31:53.890
T-That's right,

31:54.310 --> 31:55.910
Tang Yiming is already dead.

31:56.750 --> 31:57.680
He is right in...

32:00.070 --> 32:03.680
The Illusion of Mirrors and Water
combined with the soul-shifting hypnotism

32:03.680 --> 32:05.070
can make you firmly believe

32:05.070 --> 32:06.680
that you are someone else.

32:09.110 --> 32:10.570
Please take a closer look.

32:15.550 --> 32:17.200
Do you remember now?

32:43.110 --> 32:44.640
Why is it empty?

32:45.510 --> 32:47.640
With the Liluo people's help, Tang Wei

32:47.960 --> 32:50.270
learned the Illusion of Mirrors and Water.

32:50.270 --> 32:52.160
Ten years ago,
when you were seriously ill,

32:52.160 --> 32:54.440
he seized the chance
to alter your appearance

32:54.440 --> 32:56.790
and applied the soul-shifting hypnotism.

32:56.790 --> 32:57.590
This way,

32:57.680 --> 32:59.510
you were completely convinced

32:59.510 --> 33:01.680
that you were the butler
of the Tang Mansion,

33:01.680 --> 33:02.790
Qin Dayuan.

33:02.880 --> 33:03.920
The proof is that

33:04.510 --> 33:05.400
the Divine Constable Bureau

33:05.400 --> 33:07.240
couldn't find
Tang Yiming's corpse anywhere.

33:07.240 --> 33:08.400
He's not dead,

33:08.440 --> 33:10.240
so there's no corpse of his.

33:10.510 --> 33:12.440
Tang Wei wanted Tang Yiming to live

33:12.640 --> 33:13.880
and even become another person

33:13.880 --> 33:15.110
to help him take revenge

33:15.110 --> 33:16.310
and kill the accomplices like Huang Gang

33:16.310 --> 33:17.110
and Jiang Zeshui.

33:17.110 --> 33:18.370
But come to think of it.

33:19.070 --> 33:20.110
If we hadn't exposed

33:20.110 --> 33:21.310
the Illusion of Mirrors and Water,

33:21.310 --> 33:22.510
Tang Yiming would have died

33:22.510 --> 33:23.830
believing that he was Qin Dayuan.

33:23.830 --> 33:24.720
In this case,

33:24.920 --> 33:25.750
wouldn't Tang Wei's revenge

33:25.750 --> 33:27.000
come to nothing?

33:52.480 --> 33:54.510
Where did you find this corpse

33:55.270 --> 33:56.920
and the luminous pearl?

33:56.920 --> 33:59.270
There is a secret chamber
in Tang Wei's room.

33:59.270 --> 34:00.960
Tang Wei left a will stating that no one

34:00.960 --> 34:02.110
is allowed to enter his room other than

34:02.110 --> 34:03.640
those from the Divine Constable Bureau,

34:03.640 --> 34:05.680
not even Qin Dayuan.

34:13.320 --> 34:14.400
I see.

34:15.440 --> 34:16.440
This way,

34:16.880 --> 34:18.880
even the silliest person would know

34:18.880 --> 34:21.210
that there is a secret
hidden in that room.

34:21.960 --> 34:23.630
Turns out that Tang Wei had long planned

34:23.630 --> 34:25.630
for the Divine Constable Bureau
to find the body.

34:25.630 --> 34:27.389
Once we find the body,

34:27.550 --> 34:30.000
we'd know that he is fake Qin Dayuan.

34:30.110 --> 34:32.639
There is a secret left
in this luminous pearl.

34:32.659 --> 34:33.469
So,

34:34.320 --> 34:35.670
even if we failed to expose

34:35.670 --> 34:38.230
the trick
of the Illusion of Mirrors and Water,

34:38.230 --> 34:40.489
we would still be able to learn the truth.

34:40.670 --> 34:42.000
What if I say this item

34:42.030 --> 34:44.440
is related to Liluo?

34:52.110 --> 34:52.920
So,

34:53.880 --> 34:54.960
Mr. Tang left the jade pendant

34:54.960 --> 34:56.280
to me

34:57.280 --> 34:58.810
actually for this purpose.

34:59.510 --> 35:00.610
He knew we would definitely

35:00.610 --> 35:02.010
find the luminous pearl,

35:02.070 --> 35:03.670
and he also knew
you would definitely discover

35:03.670 --> 35:06.870
the mechanism of the luminous pearl
and the jade pendant.

35:40.150 --> 35:42.320
Tang Wei recorded how he used

35:42.760 --> 35:45.090
the Illusion of Mirrors and Water to alter

35:46.150 --> 35:47.230
Lord Tang's appearance

35:47.230 --> 35:48.430
in the form of images.

35:50.480 --> 35:52.140
The Tang family's mechanisms

35:52.500 --> 35:54.320
are indeed ingenious.

36:05.110 --> 36:05.710
Can't believe

36:05.710 --> 36:06.960
he recorded all the crimes

36:06.960 --> 36:08.320
he committed one by one.

36:09.880 --> 36:11.960
As long as we discover the images stored

36:11.960 --> 36:13.290
in this luminous pearl,

36:13.670 --> 36:15.590
the whole story and the truth

36:16.070 --> 36:17.670
will just come to light.

36:18.110 --> 36:20.110
I taught him the mechanism skills.

36:20.960 --> 36:22.760
This child was really talented.

36:24.110 --> 36:25.880
He was clever

36:26.680 --> 36:28.140
and surpassed his master.

36:28.880 --> 36:30.710
He made this for me to see.

36:31.110 --> 36:32.110
He wanted me

36:32.750 --> 36:35.320
to regret it for the rest of my life.

36:37.550 --> 36:38.440
Lord Tang,

36:39.360 --> 36:40.630
please go back with us.

36:42.960 --> 36:44.760
Although you killed General Hu,

36:44.760 --> 36:46.320
Lord Huang, and Lord Jiang,

36:46.630 --> 36:47.880
your mind was controlled by someone else.

36:47.880 --> 36:49.080
You are also a victim.

36:49.280 --> 36:50.550
You won't receive a heavy sentence.

36:50.550 --> 36:51.710
What is

36:54.630 --> 36:55.590
the point

36:57.320 --> 36:59.440
of living for me?

37:04.280 --> 37:05.110
Lord Tang,

37:05.710 --> 37:07.670
Mr. Tang was scheming,

37:07.880 --> 37:08.670
but

37:12.150 --> 37:13.400
he never forgot the bond you shared

37:13.400 --> 37:15.000
as father and son.

37:15.880 --> 37:17.880
The bond we shared as father and son?

37:19.670 --> 37:20.880
You are wrong.

37:21.440 --> 37:24.000
Wei didn't hate Huang Gang,

37:24.510 --> 37:25.670
Hu Hai,

37:26.670 --> 37:28.110
or Jiang Zeshui.

37:30.280 --> 37:31.880
He hated me.

37:32.750 --> 37:34.440
He hated me for saving him,

37:34.480 --> 37:35.590
raising him,

37:36.070 --> 37:38.230
and making him suffer

37:39.920 --> 37:43.400
in this living hell for 47 years.

37:45.840 --> 37:46.710
You are wrong.

37:49.840 --> 37:50.630
Look.

38:02.360 --> 38:03.110
I will definitely

38:03.110 --> 38:04.910
give you the best of everything.

38:05.550 --> 38:06.880
I will make it up to you

38:07.120 --> 38:09.250
and raise you to be an outstanding man.

38:16.280 --> 38:17.110
This is...

38:22.880 --> 38:24.280
Father, try this.

38:24.280 --> 38:25.400
It's really delicious.

38:25.400 --> 38:26.370
No, thanks.

38:26.480 --> 38:27.480
Just take a bite.

38:27.480 --> 38:27.960
Just one bite.

38:27.960 --> 38:29.440
Alright, I'll take a bite.

38:30.030 --> 38:31.770
[Dignity]

38:42.440 --> 38:43.230
Father!

38:45.550 --> 38:46.360
Wei.

38:51.710 --> 38:54.740
[Dignity]

39:17.920 --> 39:18.670
Wei,

39:19.280 --> 39:20.510
I will be away for a few days.

39:20.510 --> 39:22.370
Don't forget to do your homework.

39:24.920 --> 39:26.120
Don't worry, Father.

39:44.440 --> 39:46.040
Although Tang Wei hated you,

39:46.920 --> 39:48.150
he remembered

39:48.150 --> 39:49.230
every moment

39:49.760 --> 39:51.030
you shared.

39:51.110 --> 39:51.920
That's right.

39:52.880 --> 39:55.080
The Liluo luminous pearl is priceless.

39:55.280 --> 39:56.760
He insisted on making this mechanism

39:56.760 --> 39:58.620
even at the cost of destroying it.

39:59.070 --> 40:01.000
It's enough to prove that your bond

40:01.030 --> 40:03.320
mattered so much to him.

40:05.670 --> 40:06.510
Wei,

40:07.360 --> 40:08.670
you painstakingly

40:09.280 --> 40:11.670
laid out your plans for the past 10 years.

40:14.030 --> 40:18.030
And you left alone,

40:18.670 --> 40:20.030
without even knowing

40:22.110 --> 40:24.590
if your plans would succeed.

40:25.840 --> 40:26.630
Wei,

40:27.230 --> 40:30.280
you were just like how you used to be
when you were a child.

40:30.280 --> 40:32.590
I am coming to reunite with you now.

40:46.000 --> 40:46.800
My Lord.

41:19.440 --> 41:21.240
Perhaps living was the real pain

41:22.070 --> 41:23.440
to him, just as he said.

41:25.320 --> 41:26.510
Before he died,

41:27.510 --> 41:30.110
he learned that Tang Wei
still cared about him.

41:30.150 --> 41:30.960
I suppose...

41:32.840 --> 41:34.670
he died without regrets.

41:40.310 --> 41:41.820
[God of Hatred, Haiqu]

41:57.280 --> 41:58.280
-Chief.
-Chief.

41:59.110 --> 42:00.280
Tang Yiming is dead,

42:00.320 --> 42:01.880
but we still haven't figured out

42:01.880 --> 42:03.140
who the former citizen

42:03.150 --> 42:04.630
of Liluo he mentioned really is.

42:04.630 --> 42:06.670
This case is not solved yet.

42:10.510 --> 42:11.280
Li Si,

42:11.840 --> 42:12.670
you once said that

42:12.670 --> 42:14.000
a middle-aged man with a square face

42:14.000 --> 42:14.860
and narrow eyes

42:15.280 --> 42:16.940
showed up at Lanyue Pavilion.

42:17.360 --> 42:18.630
I asked him before,

42:19.550 --> 42:20.920
and he said he forgot.

42:20.920 --> 42:22.230
How would he confess?

42:22.670 --> 42:24.270
He must be hiding something.

42:24.670 --> 42:26.190
Seems like we still need

42:26.190 --> 42:27.110
to arrest everyone

42:27.110 --> 42:29.150
in the Tang Mansion
for strict interrogation.

42:29.150 --> 42:30.510
With so many people at Lanyue Pavilion,

42:30.510 --> 42:33.440
someone must have seen
that former citizen of Liluo.

42:36.030 --> 42:37.840
I wonder if you agree, Chief.

42:49.760 --> 42:52.290
So you've been thinking about

42:52.510 --> 42:54.280
that person outside the Tianshu Pavilion

42:54.280 --> 42:55.510
and suspecting me

42:55.920 --> 42:57.980
ever since the Lanyue Pavilion case.

42:58.510 --> 42:59.440
Then,

43:00.030 --> 43:01.110
follow me.

43:26.370 --> 43:29.140
[Tianshu Pavilion]

44:22.760 --> 44:23.550
You're here.

44:24.330 --> 44:25.770
What took you so long?

44:26.590 --> 44:27.400
Master,

44:29.360 --> 44:31.220
I am looking for a middle-aged man

44:31.630 --> 44:33.840
with a square face and narrow eyes.

44:36.550 --> 44:37.440
Too bad

44:38.280 --> 44:40.280
I haven't seen such a person.

44:45.550 --> 44:47.010
The person I'm looking for

44:48.030 --> 44:49.110
once stayed

44:50.670 --> 44:52.730
at Lanyue Pavilion several days ago.

44:54.840 --> 44:55.970
What a coincidence.

44:57.230 --> 44:58.840
I actually went

44:58.840 --> 45:01.030
to Lanyue Pavilion the other day.

45:02.710 --> 45:05.280
It's the Top 1 Pavilion in Great Shi,
where you can

45:05.280 --> 45:07.610
go up high
and enjoy the view from up there.

45:07.670 --> 45:09.110
And best of all,

45:10.510 --> 45:11.440
it's quiet.

45:14.070 --> 45:15.800
It's much more to my liking

45:17.510 --> 45:19.970
compared to your Star-Gathering Pavilion.

45:26.760 --> 45:28.220
The person I'm looking for

45:30.030 --> 45:31.230
is from Liluo.
